---
import Prose from "../layouts/Prose.astro";
import { company } from "../data/company";

/* The other address a store asks for before it will take a submission. */
---

<Prose
  title="Support"
  heading="Support"
  description="How to reach Quartz Labs about its applications or this site."
>
  <div>
    <h2 class="type-heading">The applications</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2 type-body mt-4">
      Voltz Wallet and Nyx Wallet are in development. Neither has been released, so there
      is nothing to install yet. If you are testing one, write and say which.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="type-heading">This site</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2 type-body mt-4">
      If something here is broken, wrong or unreadable, it is worth telling us. The source
      is public, so an issue works as well as an email.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="type-heading">How to reach us</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2 type-body mt-4">
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`} class="prose-link">{company.email}</a>.
      Messages are read and answered by the person who does the work.
    </p>
  </div>
</Prose>
